    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything is just so quiet now. i wake up and for a split second i forget, and then it hits me all over again that he isnt here. the house feels like a tomb. i don't see the point in even trying to make it through the day anymore. what's the point of being here if the only person who made it worth it is gone?",
