    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like i'm just going through the motions. like i'm a ghost already. i look at my bed and his side is just... empty. and every morning i have to face this reality again. i'm so, so tired of fighting to feel okay when nothing is going to change. it feels like i'm just stuck in this world that he isn't in anymore. does it ever get easier, or is it just meant to be this miserable?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
