      "content": "a new normal... that sounds even worse than it does now. just a forever version of this misery. sometimes i think about how much simpler it would be if i didn't have to wake up to this silence. if i could just stop the clock and go where he went. is that just me being selfish? thinking that being with him is better than being here alone?",
